---
// 首页唯一的 3D island。low 档只显示静态回退，不加载 three.js；书本阅读器是纯 HTML，三档都能用。
import type { SiteData } from '../scene/types';
interface Props { data: SiteData }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="scene" data-tier="pending" data-mode="" aria-label="我的小屋">
  <div class="fallback" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="sun"></div>
    <div class="sea"></div>
    <div class="mullion" style="left:33%"></div>
    <div class="mullion" style="left:66%"></div>
  </div>
  <canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <!-- 加载中：3D 的贴图、模型都到齐、画过几帧以后才揭开（用户要的「没加载好的时候显示加载中，不要展示加载一半的状态」） -->
  <div class="loading" role="status" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="ld-box">
      <div class="ld-lamp" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="ld-title">我的小屋收拾中…</p>
      <div class="ld-bar"><i></i></div>
      <p class="ld-pct">0%</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="overlay">
    <div class="intro">
      <h1>{data.name}</h1>
      <p>{data.tagline}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="top-right">
      <button class="playing" type="button" hidden>♪ <span></span> · 停止</button>
      <button class="back" type="button" hidden>← 返回 <kbd>ESC</kbd></button>
    </div>
    <!-- 底部一排入口：暖色毛玻璃的「坞」，线条图标 + 字，按读 / 屋里 / 吃 / 玩分成四组（用户嫌过原来那排胶囊按钮不够高级） -->
    <nav class="chips" aria-label="快捷入口">
      <a href="#" data-book="about"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.6"/><path d="M4.5 20c.8-3.8 3.9-6 7.5-6s6.7 2.2 7.5 6"/></svg><span>关于我</span></a>
      <a href={data.postsIndex} data-book="posts"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3.5h8.5L19 8v12.5H6z"/><path d="M14 3.5V8h5"/><path d="M9 12h7M9 15.5h7M9 19h4"/></svg><span>文章</span></a>
      <a href="#" data-action="search" data-webgl-only><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="12" rx="1.5"/><path d="M9 20h6M12 16v4"/></svg><span>电脑</span></a>
      <i class="sep" aria-hidden="true" data-webgl-only></i>
      <a href="#" data-action="window" data-webgl-only><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="3.5" width="16" height="17" rx="1"/><path d="M12 3.5v17M4 12h16M7.5 7.5h1.5M15 15h1.5"/></svg><span>看窗外</span></a>
      <a href="#" data-action="time" data-webgl-only><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"/></svg><span>时间</span></a>
      <i class="sep" aria-hidden="true" data-webgl-only></i>
      <a href="#" data-action="fridge" data-webgl-only><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="2.5" width="12" height="19" rx="2"/><path d="M6 10h12M9 6v2M9 13v3"/></svg><span>冰箱</span></a>
      <a href="#" data-action="cook" data-webgl-only><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12.5h14a0 0 0 0 1 0 0 7 7 0 0 1-14 0z"/><path d="M17 13.5l4-1.5"/><path d="M8 9c0-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5-3M12 9c0-1.5 1.5-1.5 1.5-3"/></svg><span>做饭</span></a>
      <i class="sep" aria-hidden="true" data-webgl-only></i>
      <a href="#" data-action="music" data-webgl-only><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="5.5" width="19" height="13" rx="2"/><circle cx="8" cy="11" r="2"/><circle cx="16" cy="11" r="2"/><path d="M10 11h4M6.5 18.5l1.5-3h8l1.5 3"/></svg><span>音乐</span></a>
      <a href="#" data-action="radio" data-webgl-only><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="9" width="18" height="11.5" rx="2"/><path d="M7 9l10-5.5"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="14.75" r="2.6"/><path d="M14 13h4M14 16.5h4"/></svg><span>收音机</span></a>
      <a href="#" data-action="games"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7.5h10a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 4.3 5.8l-1.2 4a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-4.2.8L14.3 16H9.7l-1.6 2.1a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-4.2-.8l-1.2-4A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7 7.5z"/><path d="M7.5 10.5v3M6 12h3"/><circle cx="15.5" cy="11" r=".9"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="13" r=".9"/></svg><span>游戏</span></a>
    </nav>
    <div class="zoom" data-webgl-only role="group" aria-label="视角">
      <button type="button" data-zoom="1" aria-label="拉近">＋</button>
      <button type="button" data-zoom="-1" aria-label="拉远">－</button>
      <button type="button" data-zoom="0" aria-label="复位视角">⟲</button>
    </div>
    <p class="cup-hint" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
    <div class="dish" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
      <p class="dish-name"></p>
      <p class="dish-hearts" role="img"></p>
      <p class="dish-comment"></p>
    </div>
    <div class="radio" role="group" aria-label="收音机" hidden>
      <button type="button" data-seek="-1" aria-label="上一个台">◀</button>
      <div class="dial">
        <p><b class="freq">FM 100.6</b> <span class="station"></span></p>
        <input type="range" min="87.5" max="108" step="0.1" value="100.6" aria-label="调频频率" />
      </div>
      <button type="button" data-seek="1" aria-label="下一个台">▶</button>
      <button type="button" class="radio-off" aria-label="关掉收音机">✕</button>
    </div>
    <!-- 站到座钟前拨时间时，底部显示现在拨到几点，和「回到现在」 -->
    <div class="timepanel" role="group" aria-label="拨时间" hidden>
      <p><b class="tp-time">清晨 6:30</b> <span class="tp-real"></span></p>
      <p class="tp-tip">在表盘上拖动指针拨时间：分针转一圈是一小时，拖时针更快</p>
      <button type="button" class="tp-now">回到现在</button>
    </div>
    <p class="hint"><span class="wide">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 点窗外看菜园 · 点书、磁带、咖啡、饭菜、黄历、座钟（拨时间）、茶几（泡茶）、左墙前面的灶台（炒菜）、冰箱上的便利贴和火车票、左墙的青海湖、书顶上的掌机、右墙书架、显示器 · 录音机上的「波段」旋钮切收音机</span><span class="narrow">拖动旋转 · 双指缩放 · 点一点桌上的东西</span></p>
  </div>

  <!-- 镜头推到显示器时，屏幕的位置叠一个真正的网页框：本站的文章列表，点进去就是文章（用户要的「只放我自己的博客文章列表和展开博客」） -->
  <div class="screen-ui" hidden><iframe title="博客文章" tabindex="0"></iframe></div>

  <div class="reader" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="书">
    <button class="close" type="button" aria-label="合上书">×</button>
    {data.books.map((b) => (
      <article class={`book ${b.kind}`} data-book={b.id} hidden>
        <div class="cover" style={`--c:${b.color}`} aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="front"><strong>{b.title}</strong>{b.author && <span>{b.author}</span>}</div>
          <div class="back"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pages" tabindex="0">
          <section class="page title-page">
            <h2>{b.title}</h2>
            {b.author && <p class="author">{b.author}</p>}
          </section>
          {b.pages.map((p) => (
            <section class="page">
              {p.heading && <h3>{p.heading}</h3>}
              {p.lines.map((l) => typeof l === 'string'
                ? <p>{l}</p>
                : <p class="link"><a href={l.href}>{l.text}</a>{l.meta && <small>{l.meta}</small>}</p>)}
            </section>
          ))}
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
    <div class="turn">
      <button type="button" data-turn="-1" aria-label="上一页">‹</button>
      <button type="button" data-turn="1" aria-label="下一页">›</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- 点桌上的黄历：放大看这一页，可以前后翻别的日子 -->
  <div class="handheld" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="掌机：贪吃蛇和小飞机" hidden>
    <div class="hh">
      <div class="jc jc-l">
        <span class="mini" aria-hidden="true">−</span>
        <span class="stick" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="dpad">
          <button type="button" data-k="up" aria-label="上">▲</button>
          <button type="button" data-k="left" aria-label="左">◀</button>
          <button type="button" data-k="right" aria-label="右">▶</button>
          <button type="button" data-k="down" aria-label="下">▼</button>
        </div>
        <span class="cap" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="hh-body"><canvas width="640" height="360"></canvas></div>
      <div class="jc jc-r">
        <span class="mini" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
        <div class="abxy">
          <span class="x" aria-hidden="true">X</span>
          <button type="button" data-k="b" class="b" aria-label="B（返回）">B</button>
          <button type="button" data-k="a" class="a" aria-label="A（确定 / 飞）">A</button>
          <span class="y" aria-hidden="true">Y</span>
        </div>
        <span class="stick" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <button type="button" data-k="home" class="home" aria-label="HOME（回到主页）">⌂</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="hh-tip">方向键 · 空格 / A · H 回主页 · ESC 放下</p>
    <button type="button" class="hh-close">放下 <kbd>ESC</kbd></button>
  </div>
  <div class="project" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="开源项目" hidden>
    <div class="project-card">
      <button type="button" class="project-close" aria-label="关上">✕</button>
      <p class="project-lang"></p>
      <h2 class="project-name"></h2>
      <p class="project-desc"></p>
      <div class="project-posts"></div>
      <a class="project-gh" target="_blank" rel="noopener">在 GitHub 上看 →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="almanac" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="黄历" hidden>
    <div class="almanac-card">
      <canvas width="600" height="840" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <div class="almanac-nav">
        <button type="button" data-day="-1" aria-label="前一天">‹ 前一天</button>
        <button type="button" data-day="0">今天</button>
        <button type="button" data-day="1" aria-label="后一天">后一天 ›</button>
      </div>
      <dl class="almanac-text"></dl>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="site-data" set:html={JSON.stringify(data)} />
</section>

<script>
  import { detectTier } from '../scene/tier';

  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.scene')!;
  const $ = <T extends HTMLElement>(s: string) => root.querySelector<T>(s)!;
  const data = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('site-data')!.textContent!);
  const bus = new EventTarget();
  const emit = (type: string, detail?: unknown) => bus.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent(type, { detail }));
  const on = <T,>(type: string, fn: (d: T) => void) => bus.addEventListener(type, (e) => fn((e as CustomEvent<T>).detail));

  // ---- 书本阅读器（不依赖 WebGL）----
  const reader = $<HTMLElement>('.reader');
  const books = [...reader.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.book')];
  let open: HTMLElement | null = null;
  on<{ id: string; from?: string }>('book:open', ({ id, from }) => {
    open = books.find((b) => b.dataset.book === id) ?? null;
    if (!open) return;
    books.forEach((b) => { b.hidden = b !== open; });
    reader.hidden = false;
    // 翻开动画：合着的书从它在桌上的大致位置飞到中央，封面绕书脊翻开
    open.style.setProperty('--fx', from === 'desk' ? '-22vw' : '-27vw');
    open.style.setProperty('--fy', from === 'desk' ? '26vh' : '10vh');
    open.classList.remove('opening');
    void open.offsetWidth; // 重新触发动画
    open.classList.add('opening');
    root.dataset.mode = 'book';
    open.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.pages')!.scrollLeft = 0;
    $<HTMLButtonElement>('.reader .close').focus();
  });
  on('book:close', () => {
    if (!open) return;
    open = null; reader.hidden = true;
    if (root.dataset.mode === 'book') root.dataset.mode = '';
  });
  const turn = (dir: number) => {
    const pages = open?.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.pages'); if (!pages) return;
    const rtl = open!.classList.contains('classic'); // 古籍从右往左翻
    pages.scrollBy({ left: dir * (rtl ? -1 : 1) * pages.clientWidth, behavior: 'smooth' });
  };
  reader.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-turn]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => turn(Number(b.dataset.turn))));
  $('.reader .close').addEventListener('click', () => emit('book:close'));
  reader.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (e.target === reader) emit('book:close'); });
  root.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('.chips [data-book]').forEach((a) =>
    a.addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); emit('book:open', { id: a.dataset.book }); }));

  // ---- 显示器：屏幕上叠一个真的网页框，放本站的文章列表 / 文章 ----
  const screenUi = $<HTMLDivElement>('.screen-ui');
  const frame = screenUi.querySelector('iframe')!;
  const back = $<HTMLButtonElement>('.back');
  const postsBase = new URL(data.postsIndex, location.href).pathname;
  // 网页框里的页面是零脚本的文章页：载入后从外面（同源）给它补几样东西——固定浅色（和 3D 屏幕上画的一样）、
  // 去掉「Home」（点了会在屏幕里再开一个小屋）、外站链接改在新标签页打开、站内只许在 /posts/ 下面走、ESC 退出
  const fixFrame = () => {
    let doc: Document | null = null;
    try { doc = frame.contentDocument; } catch { return; }
    if (!doc || !doc.body) return;
    if (!doc.location.pathname.startsWith(postsBase)) { doc.location.replace(data.postsIndex); return; }
    const st = doc.createElement('style');
    st.textContent = ':root{color-scheme:light;--bg:#f7f5f0;--fg:#1d1b18;--muted:#6b665e;--accent:#c2410c;--line:#e2ddd3}.site-header .brand{visibility:hidden}.site-footer{display:none}';
    doc.head.appendChild(st);
    doc.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      const a = (e.target as Element).closest?.('a'); if (!a || !a.href) return;
      const u = new URL(a.href, doc!.location.href);
      if (u.origin !== location.origin) { e.preventDefault(); window.open(u.href, '_blank', 'noopener'); }
      else if (!u.pathname.startsWith(postsBase)) e.preventDefault();
    });
    doc.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Escape') emit('monitor:blur'); });
  };
  frame.addEventListener('load', fixFrame);
  const loadFrame = () => { if (!frame.getAttribute('src')) frame.src = data.postsIndex; };
  on('load:done', () => setTimeout(loadFrame, 2500)); // 揭开小屋以后悄悄先载好，第一次推近就是现成的
  on('monitor:focus', () => {
    if (root.dataset.mode === 'window') emit('window:blur');
    loadFrame();
    root.dataset.mode = 'monitor'; back.hidden = false; screenUi.hidden = false;
  });
  on('monitor:blur', () => {
    if (root.dataset.mode === 'monitor') root.dataset.mode = '';
    back.hidden = true; screenUi.hidden = true; frame.blur();
  });
  on<{ x: number; y: number; w: number; h: number } | null>('monitor:rect', (r) => {
    if (!r) return;
    Object.assign(screenUi.style, { left: `${r.x}px`, top: `${r.y}px`, width: `${r.w}px`, height: `${r.h}px` });
    // 网页至少按 760（手机上 500）宽排版再缩放进屏幕：电脑上屏幕本来就有 900 来宽，原样显示、字最清楚；
    // 手机上屏幕只有三四百宽，整页等比缩小一点（不缩会挤成一长条，按 760 缩字又太小）
    const vw = Math.max(r.w, r.w < 600 ? 500 : 760), sc = r.w / vw;
    Object.assign(frame.style, { width: `${vw}px`, height: `${r.h / sc}px`, transform: `scale(${sc})` });
  });
  back.addEventListener('click', () => { emit('monitor:blur'); emit('window:blur'); emit('cup:blur'); emit('calendar:close'); emit('fridge:close'); emit('shelf:blur'); emit('clock:blur'); emit('inspect:blur'); emit('tea:blur'); emit('stove:blur'); });
  // ---- 看右墙边的书架（顶上的奖杯）----
  on('shelf:focus', () => {
    for (const t of ['monitor:blur', 'window:blur', 'cup:blur', 'calendar:close', 'fridge:close']) emit(t);
    root.dataset.mode = 'shelf'; back.hidden = false;
  });
  // 打开别的视角时离开书架（runtime 和镜头也要收到 shelf:blur）
  for (const t of ['window:focus', 'monitor:focus', 'cup:focus', 'book:open', 'calendar:open', 'handheld:open']) on(t, () => emit('shelf:blur'));
  on('shelf:blur', () => {
    if (root.dataset.mode !== 'shelf') return;
    root.dataset.mode = ''; back.hidden = true;
  });
  // ---- 冰箱 ----
  on('fridge:open', () => {
    for (const t of ['monitor:blur', 'window:blur', 'cup:blur', 'calendar:close', 'shelf:blur']) emit(t);
    root.dataset.mode = 'fridge'; back.hidden = false;
  });
  on('fridge:close', () => {
    if (root.dataset.mode !== 'fridge') return;
    root.dataset.mode = ''; back.hidden = true;
  });

  // ---- 拉近看咖啡 ----
  const cupHint = $<HTMLParagraphElement>('.cup-hint');
  on('cup:focus', () => {
    if (root.dataset.mode === 'monitor') emit('monitor:blur');
    if (root.dataset.mode === 'window') emit('window:blur');
    root.dataset.mode = 'cup'; back.hidden = false;
  });
  on('cup:blur', () => {
    if (root.dataset.mode !== 'cup') return;
    root.dataset.mode = ''; back.hidden = true;
  });
  on<{ msg: string } | null>('cup:state', (s) => { cupHint.hidden = !s; if (s) cupHint.textContent = s.msg; });

  // ---- 走到窗前看菜园 ----
  on('window:focus', () => {
    if (root.dataset.mode === 'monitor') emit('monitor:blur');
    root.dataset.mode = 'window'; back.hidden = false;
  });
  on('window:blur', () => {
    if (root.dataset.mode !== 'window') return;
    root.dataset.mode = ''; back.hidden = true;
  });

  // ---- 音乐 ----
  const playing = $<HTMLButtonElement>('.playing');
  let now: string | null = null;
  on<{ id: string; title: string } | null>('music:state', (s) => {
    now = s?.id ?? null; playing.hidden = !s;
    if (s) playing.querySelector('span')!.textContent = s.title;
  });
  playing.addEventListener('click', () => emit('disc:stop'));

  // ---- 黄历 ----
  const alm = $<HTMLDivElement>('.almanac');
  const almCanvas = alm.querySelector('canvas')!;
  let almDay: Date | null = null;
  const showDay = async (d: Date) => {
    almDay = d;
    const A = await import('../almanac');
    const L = await A.loadLunar().catch(() => null);
    if (almDay !== d) return;
    const info = L ? A.fullInfo(L, d) : A.basicInfo(d);
    const dpr = Math.min(2, devicePixelRatio || 1);
    almCanvas.width = 600 * dpr; almCanvas.height = 840 * dpr;
    A.drawPage(almCanvas.getContext('2d')!, almCanvas.width, almCanvas.height, info);
    const l = info.lunar;
    const rows: [string, string][] = l ? [
      ['公历', `${d.getFullYear()}年${d.getMonth() + 1}月${d.getDate()}日 ${info.week}${info.holiday ? ' · ' + info.holiday : ''}`],
      ['农历', `${l.yearGz}年（${l.zodiac}）${l.month}月${l.day} · ${l.monthGz}月 ${l.dayGz}日`],
      ['宜', l.yi.join(' ')], ['忌', l.ji.join(' ')],
      ['吉神宜趋', l.jishen.join(' ')], ['凶神宜忌', l.xiongsha.join(' ')],
      ['冲煞', `${l.chong} 煞${l.sha}`], ['彭祖百忌', l.pengzu],
    ] : [['公历', `${d.getFullYear()}年${d.getMonth() + 1}月${d.getDate()}日 ${info.week}`]];
    const dl = alm.querySelector('dl')!;
    dl.replaceChildren(...rows.flatMap(([k, v]) => { const dt = document.createElement('dt'), dd = document.createElement('dd'); dt.textContent = k; dd.textContent = v; return [dt, dd]; }));
  };
  const today = () => { const n = new Date(); return new Date(n.getFullYear(), n.getMonth(), n.getDate()); };
  // 打开：先把这一页画好，再让大图从桌上那一页的位置「拿起来」——带着日历的后仰角度，翻正、放大到屏幕中间
  type Rect = { left: number; top: number; width: number; height: number };
  const card = alm.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('.almanac-card')!;
  const extras = [...card.children].filter((c) => c !== almCanvas) as HTMLElement[];
  const still = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
  let fromRect: Rect | null = null, almBusy = false;
  const flyFrom = (r: Rect) => {
    const f = almCanvas.getBoundingClientRect();
    const dx = r.left + r.width / 2 - (f.left + f.width / 2), dy = r.top + r.height / 2 - (f.top + f.height / 2);
    return `translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) perspective(900px) rotateX(14deg) scale(${r.width / f.width}, ${r.height / f.height})`;
  };
  const EASE = 'cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.2,1)';
  on<{ rect?: Rect }>('calendar:open', async (d) => {
    if (!alm.hidden || almBusy) return;
    almBusy = true;
    for (const t of ['monitor:blur', 'window:blur', 'cup:blur']) emit(t);
    await showDay(today());
    alm.hidden = false; alm.scrollTop = 0; root.dataset.mode = 'calendar';
    emit('calendar:shown'); // 大图已经盖在桌上那一页上了：3D 那页可以「拿走」
    fromRect = d?.rect ?? null;
    if (fromRect && !still.matches) {
      almCanvas.animate([{ transform: flyFrom(fromRect), boxShadow: 'none' }, { transform: 'none' }], { duration: 650, easing: EASE });
      alm.animate([{ backgroundColor: 'rgba(11,20,36,0)', backdropFilter: 'blur(0px)' }, {}], { duration: 500, easing: 'ease-out' });
      for (const el of extras) el.animate([{ opacity: 0, transform: 'translateY(12px)' }, { opacity: 0, offset: 0.5 }, {}], { duration: 750, easing: 'ease-out' });
    }
    almBusy = false;
  });
  on('calendar:close', async () => {
    if (alm.hidden || almBusy) return;
    almBusy = true;
    if (fromRect && !still.matches) {
      const a = almCanvas.animate([{}, { transform: flyFrom(fromRect), boxShadow: 'none' }], { duration: 420, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.5,0,.75,.4)', fill: 'forwards' });
      alm.animate([{}, { backgroundColor: 'rgba(11,20,36,0)', backdropFilter: 'blur(0px)' }], { duration: 420, fill: 'forwards' });
      for (const el of extras) el.animate([{}, { opacity: 0 }], { duration: 180, fill: 'forwards' });
      await a.finished.catch(() => {});
    }
    alm.hidden = true; almDay = null;
    for (const el of [almCanvas, alm, ...extras]) el.getAnimations().forEach((x) => x.cancel());
    if (root.dataset.mode === 'calendar') root.dataset.mode = '';
    emit('calendar:closed'); // 桌上那一页重新露出来
    almBusy = false;
  });
  alm.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (e.target === alm) emit('calendar:close'); });
  alm.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-day]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const n = Number(b.dataset.day);
    void showDay(n && almDay ? new Date(almDay.getFullYear(), almDay.getMonth(), almDay.getDate() + n) : today());
  }));

  // ---- 掌机（书架上那台；游戏在 src/games/handheld.ts，打开时才加载）----
  const hhUi = $<HTMLDivElement>('.handheld');
  const hhBox = hhUi.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('.hh')!;
  const hhCanvas = hhUi.querySelector<HTMLCanvasElement>('canvas')!;
  let hh: { start(): void; stop(): void; key(k: string): void } | null = null, hhFrom: Rect | null = null, hhBusy = false, has3d = false;
  /** 大掌机的屏幕对准 3D 掌机屏幕在画面上的位置：以屏幕中心为变换原点，平移 + 等比缩放 */
  const hhFly = (r: Rect) => {
    const c = hhCanvas.getBoundingClientRect(), b = hhBox.getBoundingClientRect();
    hhBox.style.transformOrigin = `${c.left - b.left + c.width / 2}px ${c.top - b.top + c.height / 2}px`;
    return `translate(${r.left + r.width / 2 - (c.left + c.width / 2)}px, ${r.top + r.height / 2 - (c.top + c.height / 2)}px) scale(${r.width / c.width})`;
  };
  on<{ rect?: Rect }>('handheld:open', async (d) => {
    if (!hhUi.hidden || hhBusy) return;
    hhBusy = true;
    for (const t of ['monitor:blur', 'window:blur', 'cup:blur', 'calendar:close', 'fridge:close']) emit(t);
    hhUi.hidden = false; root.dataset.mode = 'handheld';
    hhFrom = d?.rect ?? null;
    const anim = hhFrom && !still.matches ? hhBox.animate([{ transform: hhFly(hhFrom) }, { transform: 'none' }], { duration: 600, easing: EASE }) : null;
    hhUi.animate([{ backgroundColor: 'rgba(11,20,36,0)' }, {}], { duration: 500 });
    try {
      if (!hh) { const { createHandheld } = await import('../games/handheld'); hh = createHandheld(hhCanvas, { onSleep: () => emit('handheld:close') }); }
      hh.start();
    } catch (err) { console.error('[handheld] 游戏加载失败', err); }
    await anim?.finished.catch(() => {});
    emit('handheld:shown'); // 大掌机已经盖住 3D 那台：3D 的可以藏起来
    hhUi.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-k="a"]')!.focus({ preventScroll: true });
    hhBusy = false;
  });
  on('handheld:close', async () => {
    if (hhUi.hidden || hhBusy) return;
    hhBusy = true;
    if (hhFrom && !still.matches) {
      emit('handheld:closing');
      const a = hhBox.animate([{}, { transform: hhFly(hhFrom) }], { duration: 420, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.5,0,.75,.4)', fill: 'forwards' });
      hhUi.animate([{}, { backgroundColor: 'rgba(11,20,36,0)' }], { duration: 420, fill: 'forwards' });
      await a.finished.catch(() => {});
    }
    hh?.stop();
    hhUi.hidden = true;
    for (const el of [hhBox, hhUi]) el.getAnimations().forEach((x) => x.cancel());
    if (root.dataset.mode === 'handheld') root.dataset.mode = '';
    emit('handheld:closed'); // 3D 那台重新出来、放回书顶上
    hhBusy = false;
  });
  hhUi.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (e.target === hhUi) emit('handheld:close'); });
  hhUi.querySelector('.hh-close')!.addEventListener('click', () => emit('handheld:close'));
  // 手柄上的键：按下就算（小飞机要跟手），不等抬起
  hhUi.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-k]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); hh?.key(b.dataset.k!); }));
  hhUi.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-k]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'Enter') { e.preventDefault(); hh?.key(b.dataset.k!); } }));
  const HH_KEYS: Record<string, string> = { ArrowUp: 'up', w: 'up', W: 'up', ArrowDown: 'down', s: 'down', S: 'down', ArrowLeft: 'left', a: 'left', A: 'left', ArrowRight: 'right', d: 'right', D: 'right', ' ': 'a', Enter: 'a', j: 'a', J: 'a', z: 'a', Z: 'a', k: 'b', K: 'b', x: 'b', X: 'b', Backspace: 'b', h: 'home', H: 'home', Home: 'home' };
  addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (hhUi.hidden) return;
    const k = HH_KEYS[e.key];
    if (k) { e.preventDefault(); e.stopImmediatePropagation(); if (!e.repeat || k !== 'a') hh?.key(k); }
  }, true);
  $('[data-action="games"]').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); emit(has3d ? 'handheld:pick' : 'handheld:open', {}); });

  // ---- 开源项目卡片（右墙书架顶格的书脊）----
  const projUi = $<HTMLDivElement>('.project');
  type Proj = { id: string; name: string; color: string; desc: string; lang: string; url: string; posts: { title: string; url: string }[] };
  on<{ id: string }>('project:open', ({ id }) => {
    const pr = (data.projects as Proj[]).find((x) => x.id === id); if (!pr) return;
    projUi.querySelector('.project-lang')!.textContent = `开源项目 · ${pr.lang}`;
    projUi.querySelector('.project-name')!.textContent = pr.name;
    projUi.querySelector('.project-desc')!.textContent = pr.desc;
    const box = projUi.querySelector<HTMLDivElement>('.project-posts')!;
    box.replaceChildren(...(pr.posts.length ? [Object.assign(document.createElement('p'), { className: 'project-sub', textContent: '相关文章' }), ...pr.posts.map((x) => Object.assign(document.createElement('a'), { href: x.url, textContent: x.title }))] : []));
    const gh = projUi.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('.project-gh')!; gh.href = pr.url;
    projUi.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.project-card')!.style.setProperty('--c', pr.color);
    projUi.hidden = false;
    projUi.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.project-close')!.focus({ preventScroll: true });
  });
  on('project:close', () => { projUi.hidden = true; });
  projUi.addEventListener('click', (e) => { if (e.target === projUi) emit('project:close'); });
  projUi.querySelector('.project-close')!.addEventListener('click', () => emit('project:close'));

  // ---- 收音机（录音机的另一个波段）----
  const radioUi = $<HTMLDivElement>('.radio');
  const slider = radioUi.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('input')!;
  const STATUS = { static: '沙沙……', loading: '正在连接…', playing: '', nosignal: '收不到这个台' } as const;
  let radioOn = false;
  on<{ mhz: number; station: { name: string } | null; status: keyof typeof STATUS } | null>('radio:state', (s) => {
    radioOn = !!s; radioUi.hidden = !s;
    if (!s) return;
    radioUi.querySelector('.freq')!.textContent = `FM ${s.mhz.toFixed(1)}`;
    radioUi.querySelector('.station')!.textContent = s.station ? `${s.station.name}${STATUS[s.status] ? ' · ' + STATUS[s.status] : ''}` : STATUS.static;
    if (document.activeElement !== slider) slider.value = String(s.mhz);
  });
  slider.addEventListener('input', () => emit('radio:tune', { mhz: Number(slider.value) }));
  radioUi.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-seek]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => emit('radio:seek', { dir: Number(b.dataset.seek) })));
  radioUi.querySelector('.radio-off')!.addEventListener('click', () => emit('radio:off'));

  // ---- 拨时间（点座钟或「时间」按钮）：3D 层每半秒发一次 time:state 报当前时刻 ----
  const timeUi = $<HTMLDivElement>('.timepanel');
  const fmtH = (h: number) => {
    const hh = Math.floor(h) % 24, mm = Math.floor((h - Math.floor(h)) * 60);
    const part = hh < 5 ? '凌晨' : hh < 8 ? '清晨' : hh < 11 ? '上午' : hh < 13 ? '中午' : hh < 17 ? '下午' : hh < 19 ? '傍晚' : '晚上';
    return `${part} ${hh % 12 === 0 ? 12 : hh % 12}:${String(mm).padStart(2, '0')}`;
  };
  on<{ h: number; real: boolean }>('time:state', ({ h, real }) => {
    timeUi.querySelector('.tp-time')!.textContent = fmtH(h);
    timeUi.querySelector('.tp-real')!.textContent = real ? '· 现在的时间' : '· 拨过的时间';
    timeUi.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.tp-now')!.disabled = real;
  });
  // 站到座钟前（clock:focus）：底部显示拨到几点；点别处、ESC、返回离开
  on('clock:focus', () => {
    for (const t of ['monitor:blur', 'window:blur', 'cup:blur', 'calendar:close', 'shelf:blur', 'fridge:close']) emit(t);
    root.dataset.mode = 'clock'; back.hidden = false; timeUi.hidden = false;
  });
  for (const t of ['window:focus', 'monitor:focus', 'cup:focus', 'book:open', 'calendar:open', 'handheld:open', 'shelf:focus', 'fridge:open']) on(t, () => emit('clock:blur'));
  on('clock:blur', () => {
    timeUi.hidden = true;
    if (root.dataset.mode !== 'clock') return;
    root.dataset.mode = ''; back.hidden = true;
  });
  timeUi.querySelector('.tp-now')!.addEventListener('click', () => emit('time:real'));

  // 凑近看便利贴（inspect）、站到茶几前泡茶（tea）、站到灶台前炒菜（stove）：和座钟一样的「聚焦」——返回按钮、ESC、打开别的视角时退出
  const SIMPLE = ['inspect', 'tea', 'stove'] as const;
  const simpleFocus = (name: (typeof SIMPLE)[number]) => {
    on(`${name}:focus`, () => {
      for (const t of ['monitor:blur', 'window:blur', 'cup:blur', 'calendar:close', 'shelf:blur', 'fridge:close', 'clock:blur', ...SIMPLE.filter((x) => x !== name).map((x) => `${x}:blur`)]) emit(t);
      root.dataset.mode = name; back.hidden = false;
    });
    for (const t of ['window:focus', 'monitor:focus', 'cup:focus', 'book:open', 'calendar:open', 'handheld:open', 'shelf:focus', 'fridge:open', 'clock:focus']) on(t, () => emit(`${name}:blur`));
    on(`${name}:blur`, () => {
      if (root.dataset.mode !== name) return;
      root.dataset.mode = ''; back.hidden = true;
      if (name !== 'inspect') emit('cup:state', null);
    });
  };
  SIMPLE.forEach(simpleFocus);

  // 炒好的菜：菜名、n 颗红心、一句评价（kitchen 发 dish:show）
  const dishUi = $<HTMLDivElement>('.dish');
  on<{ name: string; hearts: number; comment: string; burnt: boolean }>('dish:show', (d) => {
    dishUi.querySelector('.dish-name')!.textContent = d.name;
    dishUi.querySelector('.dish-hearts')!.innerHTML = Array.from({ length: 5 }, (_, i) => `<span class="${i < d.hearts ? 'on' : ''}">${i < d.hearts ? '❤' : '♡'}</span>`).join('');
    dishUi.querySelector('.dish-hearts')!.setAttribute('aria-label', `喜欢程度 ${d.hearts} / 5`);
    dishUi.querySelector('.dish-comment')!.textContent = d.comment;
    dishUi.classList.toggle('burnt', d.burnt);
    dishUi.hidden = false;
  });
  on('dish:hide', () => { dishUi.hidden = true; });

  addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Escape' && !projUi.hidden) { emit('project:close'); return; }
    if (e.key === 'Escape') { emit('handheld:close'); emit('calendar:close'); emit('book:close'); emit('monitor:blur'); emit('window:blur'); emit('cup:blur'); emit('fridge:close'); emit('shelf:blur'); emit('clock:blur'); emit('inspect:blur'); emit('tea:blur'); emit('stove:blur'); }
    if (open && e.key === 'ArrowRight') turn(open.classList.contains('classic') ? -1 : 1);
    if (open && e.key === 'ArrowLeft') turn(open.classList.contains('classic') ? 1 : -1);
  });

  // ---- 3D 场景 ----
  const tier = detectTier();
  root.dataset.tier = tier;
  // low 档 / 加载前的 CSS 窗外也跟着时刻变：白天蓝天，傍晚晚霞，夜里黑天和月亮（粗分四段，3D 里是连续的）
  { const hr = new Date().getHours(); root.dataset.tod = hr >= 19 || hr < 5 ? 'night' : hr < 8 ? 'dawn' : hr < 16 ? 'day' : 'dusk'; }
  if (tier !== 'low') {
    import('../scene/runtime').then(({ start }) => {
      // 进度条：runtime 数 three 的加载器（load:progress），全部到齐、画过几帧后发 load:done 才揭开
      const ldBar = $<HTMLElement>('.ld-bar i'), ldPct = $<HTMLElement>('.ld-pct');
      on<{ p: number }>('load:progress', ({ p }) => { ldBar.style.width = `${Math.round(p * 100)}%`; ldPct.textContent = `${Math.round(p * 100)}%`; });
      on('load:done', () => { ldBar.style.width = '100%'; ldPct.textContent = '100%'; root.dataset.ready = 'true'; });
      start(root.querySelector('canvas')!, tier, data, bus);
      has3d = true;
      $('[data-action="search"]').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); emit('monitor:focus'); });
      $('[data-action="window"]').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); emit('window:focus'); });
      root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-zoom]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const dir = Number(b.dataset.zoom);
        if (dir) emit('view:zoom', { dir }); else emit('view:reset');
      }));
      $('[data-action="fridge"]').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); emit('fridge:open'); });
      $('[data-action="time"]').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); emit('clock:focus'); });
      $('[data-action="cook"]').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); emit('stove:focus'); });
      $('[data-action="radio"]').addEventListener('click', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); emit(radioOn ? 'radio:off' : 'radio:on'); });
      $('[data-action="music"]').addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const ids: string[] = data.tracks.map((t: { id: string }) => t.id);
        emit('disc:play', { id: ids[(ids.indexOf(now ?? '') + 1) % ids.length] });
      });
    }).catch((err) => {
      console.error('[scene] 初始化失败，退回静态版', err);
      root.dataset.tier = 'low'; root.dataset.ready = 'true';
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  /* 首页只有这一屏：占满整个视口，页面本身不滚动 */
  .scene { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100dvh; min-height: 420px; overflow: hidden; background: #f3c9a0; color: #fff; }
  canvas, .fallback { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  canvas { touch-action: none; } /* 页面不滚动了：单指上下拖也用来转视角 */

  /* low 档 / 加载前：一扇 CSS 画的窗，窗外是日出时的远山和稻田 */
  .fallback {
    background: linear-gradient(#5f7fb8 0%, #a9b9d8 30%, #f0c2a2 50%, #ffb07a 57%, #8fa89a 57%, #9bb07a 62%, #86a83e 62%, #5f8a34 100%);
    transition: opacity .8s;
  }
  .sun { position: absolute; left: 38%; top: 57%; width: 16vmin; height: 16vmin; margin: -8vmin 0 0 -8vmin; border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(#fff6d8 0 45%, #ffd27a 70%); box-shadow: 0 0 12vmin 6vmin #ffb86b99;
    clip-path: inset(-30vmin -30vmin 50% -30vmin); }
  .sea { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 62%; bottom: 0; /* 稻田：一垄一垄的稻子 */
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff10 0 3px, transparent 3px 14px), repeating-linear-gradient(#0000000d 0 2px, transparent 2px 22px); }
  .mullion { position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 8px; background: #4a2618; }
  .scene[data-tod='day'] .fallback { background: linear-gradient(#3f6fb8 0%, #8fb1dc 40%, #cfdbe6 57%, #8fa89a 57%, #9bb07a 62%, #86a83e 62%, #5f8a34 100%); }
  .scene[data-tod='day'] .sun { top: 18%; left: 70%; clip-path: none; }
  .scene[data-tod='dusk'] .fallback { background: linear-gradient(#4a5a8f 0%, #b48aa8 32%, #f2a98a 52%, #e8b39a 57%, #6f7f72 57%, #75865a 62%, #5f7a30 62%, #44622a 100%); }
  .scene[data-tod='dusk'] .sun { display: none; }
  .scene[data-tod='night'] .fallback { background: radial-gradient(circle at 62% 28%, #fffbe8 0 3vmin, #c9d4ff33 3.4vmin, transparent 12vmin), linear-gradient(#02040c 0%, #0a1430 50%, #121d38 57%, #0d1410 57%, #10180e 62%, #0d150b 62%, #090f08 100%); }
  .scene[data-tod='night'] .sun { display: none; }
  .scene[data-ready='true'] .fallback { opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  /* 加载中：盖住画布和上面所有按钮，到齐了淡出。low 档没有 3D，不显示 */
  .loading {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 50; display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 42%, #3a2a1c 0%, #1d1611 55%, #120d0a 100%); color: #f3e6cf;
    transition: opacity .7s ease, visibility 0s linear .7s;
  }
  .scene:is([data-ready='true'], [data-tier='low']) .loading { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
  .ld-box { display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 12px; width: min(260px, 70vw); }
  .ld-lamp { width: 34px; height: 46px; border-radius: 12px; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, #ffd79a 0%, #e8913a 55%, #9e3a1c 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 36px 10px #ffb4604d; animation: ld-flicker 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .ld-title { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: .2em; }
  .ld-bar { width: 100%; height: 3px; border-radius: 3px; background: #ffffff1f; overflow: hidden; }
  .ld-bar i { display: block; width: 0; height: 100%; background: #ffbe6a; transition: width .3s ease; }
  .ld-pct { margin: 0; font: 12px ui-monospace, monospace; color: #f3e6cfa0; }
  @keyframes ld-flicker { 50% { box-shadow: 0 0 46px 14px #ffb46066; filter: brightness(1.08); } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ld-lamp { animation: none; } }
  .scene[data-tier='low'] > canvas { display: none; }
  .scene[data-tier='low'] [data-webgl-only], .scene[data-tier='low'] .hint { display: none; }

  .overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 45% at 0 0, #0b1c3a80, transparent 70%); }
  /* 覆盖层本身不拦点击：只有按钮和链接接收，其余位置的点击和拖动都落到 3D 画面上 */
  .overlay :is(a, button), .overlay .radio, .overlay .timepanel { pointer-events: auto; }
  .intro { max-width: 520px; transition: opacity .4s; pointer-events: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 12px #0b1c3a99, 0 0 2px #0b1c3a66; }
  .intro h1 { margin: 28px 0 4px; font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 44px); letter-spacing: .02em; }
  .intro p { margin: 0; opacity: .92; }
  .scene:not([data-mode='']) .intro, .scene:not([data-mode='']) .hint { opacity: 0; }
  .scene:not([data-mode='']) .overlay { background: none; }
  .scene:is([data-mode='monitor'], [data-mode='window'], [data-mode='cup'], [data-mode='fridge'], [data-mode='shelf']) .chips { display: none; }
  .top-right { position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 16px; display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  /* 右上角的「返回」等：和底部的坞同一套暖色毛玻璃 */
  .top-right button {
    font: inherit; font-size: 14px; color: #f6ead6; cursor: pointer; letter-spacing: .04em;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a1f17cc, #17110ccc); border: 1px solid #e8c88c47; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px #0006, inset 0 1px 0 #ffecc81f; backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(1.3); transition: border-color .2s, color .2s;
  }
  .top-right button[hidden] { display: none; }
  .top-right button:hover { border-color: #e8c88c99; color: #ffe2ad; }
  /* 底部的坞：居中的一条暖色毛玻璃（深木色 + 金色细边），每个入口是线条图标 + 字，四组之间一道渐隐的竖线 */
  .chips {
    margin-top: auto; align-self: center; display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 2px; padding: 6px 8px; max-width: 100%;
